    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "What the f*ck is Melania Trump talking about?\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2043805534365614166",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-13T21:36:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"I think we are now existing in a very different media environment than the one that, like, MSNOW, New York Times and CNN want to exist in.\" \u2013Hasan Piker\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2043384364784881791",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:42:51+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"I want the Democratic party to treat me like a Never-Trumper\" \u2013Hasan Piker\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2043343686277214543",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-12T15:01:12+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"It's a NACHO, Dan!\"\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2042731521358840300",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-10T22:28:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\u201cThey\u2019re stupid people...\u201d - Donald Trump on Alex Jones, Megyn Kelly, Tucker Carlson, Candace Owens, and Marjorie Taylor Greene after they spoke up against his war with Iran.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2042657966340342011",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-10T17:36:24+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"I don\u2019t give the president of the United States, who has agency here, any pass.\" \u2013Rahm Emanuel on Trump's decision to go to war.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2042619099897897416",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-10T15:01:58+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "JD Vance discusses his wife jumping out of an airplane.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2042596146367856746",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:30:45+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Jon Favreau reacts to Josh Gottheimer talking about the Iran war.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2041966253909098759",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T19:47:47+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\u201cFor many of the folks that you see taking up oxygen on the other side of the aisle, in particular, it\u2019s not in pursuit of a rational goal. It\u2019s actually an addiction.\u201d \u2014Representative Sarah McBride on the reality TV nature of U.S. politics.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2041953472392679783",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:57:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Stephen Miller is still pursuing his inhuman immigration policy\u2014he\u2019s just doing it more quietly now.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2041871452752818233",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T13:31:05+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Tucker Carlson presents a strong case against Trump\u2019s war escalation.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2041681294241722584",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T00:55:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
